000167
000168         1100-CARREGAR-CONTAS.
000169             PERFORM VARYING IX-CT FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IX-CT > WS-MAX-CONTAS
000170                MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO WS-CT-CARTAO(IX-CT)
000171             END-PERFORM
000172             READ CONTAS-ENTRADA
000173             PERFORM UNTIL WS-FS-CON-FIM
000174                ADD 1 TO WS-QTD-CONTAS
000175                IF WS-QTD-CONTAS > WS-MAX-CONTAS
000176                   DISPLAY 'CICAUTOR - MAIS CONTAS QUE O LIMITE DA TABELA'
000177                   PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
000178                END-IF
